'''Chroma Bauble''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift}} (approximately 80,000 [[Snow Tokens]]) during the [[Christmas Event 2024|2024 Christmas Event]]. More specifically, the approximate chances of obtaining this weapon had been around 1 in 50. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Chroma Bauble has a similar appearance to [[Bauble]], but it shifts colors constantly. Instead of the red that had been on the Bauble originally, it is replaced with various shifting colors.

== Trivia ==
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Bauble]].
*It partners with the knife [[Chroma Ornament]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Bauble Set|Chroma Bauble Set]].
*Unlike [[Bauble]], Chroma Bauble sits more diagonally on the avatar.
*It is the second [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] weapon obtainable through [[Gifts|gifting]], the others being [[Chroma Evergun]] and [[Chroma Ornament]].
*Chroma Bauble and Chroma Constellation both have a unique white appearance when chroma toggled.

